[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0084","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-20103","title":"ProFTPD 1.3.3c 版本源码后门隐藏命令任意命令执行漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.3.3c 官方源码包在 2010 年 11 月 28 日至 12 月 2 日期间被植入恶意后门，攻击者通过触发隐藏的 FTP 命令即可以 root 权限在服务器上执行任意 Shell 命令。该漏洞影响使用该版本源码编译安装的 ProFTPD 服务器，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，属严重级别供应链投毒型漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-20103"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2025-08-20T16:15:34Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:16:56Z","remediation":"立即从官方渠道重新下载并升级到 ProFTPD 1.3.3d 或更高版本（1.3.3d 已移除该后门），严禁使用 2010 年 11 月 28 日至 12 月 2 日期间下载的 1.3.3c 源码包或二进制文件。升级前校验官方 GPG 签名与 SHA 校验和，确认软件完整性；若已部署受影响版本，应重置服务器凭据并检查是否存在异常 root 权限命令执行记录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.proftpd.org/","https://advisories.checkpoint.com/defense/advisories/public/2011/cpai-2010-151.html/","https://github.com/proftpd/proftpd","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/master/modules/exploits/unix/ftp/proftpd_133c_backdoor.rb","https://web.archive.org/web/20111107212129/http://rsync.proftpd.org/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16921","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/proftpd-backdoor-command-execution","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2010/CVE-2010-20103.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-20103.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/javascript/cves/2010/CVE-2010-20103.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c1abd567e9f51bcb187554798cc5956bd402e98/cves/2010/20xxx/CVE-2010-20103.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-20103.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f75ab9c4d42c6ac0916ce14ac69865bf1dcbb973/2010/20xxx/CVE-2010-20103.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/8f3fd5c72f1f22f6a06e5a55b25636ecd659c5ba/javascript/cves/2010/CVE-2010-20103.yaml","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/ad98898aca7860353055ea2aee0af12336215af4/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6593a7cdb3db460855b778a366e9ba479f28af94/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-20103.json","https://github.com/ada-yq225/FIT2173/blob/5e8a299e2875d3c2f4f5368a8bb19983c19c8964/README.md","https://github.com/Tag59/agent_pentest/blob/676f3ee7b5f80943ba84bde9d23cbc2c65540f8e/tools.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0108","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4239","title":"Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 5.2 版本存在本地文件包含漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意文件路径参数，利用输入验证不当缺陷包含本地任意文件，进而读取敏感文件或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 5.2 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，通过构造恶意文件包含路径实现任意代码执行或敏感文件读取，危害等级严重。官方已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议用户尽快升级到修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4239"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-28T15:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:25Z","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即升级至 Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware 5.3 或更高版本（官方已在 5.3 修复该 LFI 漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 tiki-print_multi_pages.php 等受影响脚本的访问，并配置 PHP 的 open_basedir 限制文件包含路径；同时在防火墙层面封禁可疑请求参数（如 page、lang 等）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/cve-2010-4239","https://dl.packetstormsecurity.net/1009-exploits/tikiwiki52-lfi.txt","https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2010-4239","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2010/11/22/9","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4239.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4239.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4239.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/04deea2d5c50b4720e70811dcb426620621d3261/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4239.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2010-4239-1997.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/bf9978ea592b7413bb96dfeb9db92cbd52bf0c3d/api/2010/CVE-2010-4239.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2010-4239.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Tiki%20Wiki%20CMS/CVE-2010-4239.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-4239_3.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2010-4239_2_1.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2010-4239-1997.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0555","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-5330","title":"Ubiquiti Networks AirOS 命令注入漏洞","description":"Ubiquiti Networks AirOS 存在命令注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向 stainfo.cgi（显示 AP 信息页面）发送特制的 GET 请求，在 ifname 参数中注入 shell 元字符来执行任意系统命令，导致远程代码执行。未经认证的远程攻击者可借此完全控制受影响设备。该漏洞影响 Ubiquiti 多款 802.11 ISP 产品、AirMax ISP 产品及 AirSync 固件版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已在 v4.0.1/v5.3.5/v5.4.5 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-5330"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-11T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:34Z","remediation":"将 802.11 ISP 产品升级至 v4.0.1 及以上版本，AirMax ISP 产品升级至 v5.3.5 及以上版本，AirSync 固件升级至 v5.4.5 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙规则限制对 stainfo.cgi 的未授权外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.ubnt.com/t5/airMAX-General-Discussion/AirOS-Security-Exploit-Updated-Firmware/td-p/212974","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/14146","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-5330","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-5330.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2010/5xxx/CVE-2010-5330.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-5330.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2010/5xxx/CVE-2010-5330.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2010/CVE-2010-5330/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-5330.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-5330.html","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2010/CVE-2010-5330.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5j2-ggvf-gwvg/GHSA-c5j2-ggvf-gwvg.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0555.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2010/EXP-AVE-2010-0555.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0520","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-5326","title":"SAP NetWeaver Application Server Java Invoker Servlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver Java 应用服务器中的 Invoker Servlet 在 7.3 版本之前未正确实施访问控制，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过构造特制的 HTTP 或 HTTPS 请求直接调用该 Servlet，从而在目标服务器上执行任意代码。该漏洞被称为 \"Detour\" 攻击，早在 2013 年至 2016 年间已被广泛利用于真实环境中，影响范围包括 SAP NetWeaver 全系列版本。由于 Servlet 容器默认开放且缺少必要的权限校验，攻击条件门槛极低，只需目标服务器暴露在网络上即可实施攻击，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-5326"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-05-13T10:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:33Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Note 1445998 提供的补丁，将 SAP NetWeaver Application Server Java 升级至 7.3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 J2EE Engine 配置中禁用 Invoker Servlet（移除 servlet 映射 /Invoker/），或通过 Web 服务器反向代理规则限制对 /Invoker/* 路径的访问，仅允许受信 IP 段访问 SAP Java 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.sap.com/sap/support/notes/1445998","http://www.onapsis.com/research/publications/sap-security-in-depth-vol4-the-invoker-servlet-a-dangerous-detour-into-sap-java-solutions","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48925","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90533","http://www.us-cert.gov/ncas/alerts/TA16-132A","https://www.onapsis.com/threat-report-tip-iceberg-wild-exploitation-cyber-attacks-sap-business-applications","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-5326","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-5326.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2010/5xxx/CVE-2010-5326.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-5326","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CVE-2010-5326-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2010/CVE-2010-5326/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-5326.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-5326.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-5326.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2010/CVE-2010-5326.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-5326.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0116","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-5286","title":"Joomla! com_jstore 组件 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Jstore（com_jstore）第三方扩展组件存在目录遍历（路径遍历）漏洞，属于 CWE-22 类型缺陷。该组件在处理 index.php 页面的 controller 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤与规范化，远程攻击者可构造包含 \"..\"（点点）序列的恶意 controller 参数提交请求，绕过目录访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、密码等敏感数据）。由于该组件作为 Joomla! 站点插件部署，凡安装并启用了存在漏洞版本 com_jstore 组件的 Joomla! 网站均受影响。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，CVSS 基础评分高达 10.0（满分），危害等级为严重，除文件读取外还可能存在其他未明确说明的安全影响。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-5286"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-11-26T23:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:28Z","remediation":"立即卸载或升级存在漏洞的 Jstore (com_jstore) 第三方组件至官方修复版本，并通过后台「扩展管理-管理」彻底移除该组件；若暂不能升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache 的 .htaccess）中对 index.php 的 controller 参数做过滤，拒绝包含「../」「..%2f」等路径穿越字符的请求，同时配置 PHP 的 open_basedir 限制脚本可访问目录，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/1010-exploits/joomlajstore-lfi.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34837","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5286.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-5286.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5286.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2010/5xxx/CVE-2010-5286.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-5286-2032.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-5286-2031.yaml","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-5286-2034.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2010-5286_10.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2010-5286-2034.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0115","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-5278","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9185,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10867}}","description":"MODx Revolution 2.0.2-pl 及更早版本的 manager/controllers/default/resource/tvs.php 文件存在路径遍历漏洞。当服务器 magic_quotes_gpc 配置被禁用时，程序未对 class_key 参数进行充分的过滤和校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在该参数中注入 \"..\"（点点）序列绕过目录限制，从而读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源代码等），造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用条件较为简单，攻击者只需构造包含目录遍历序列的恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-5278"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-10-07T20:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MODx Revolution 至 2.0.3 及以上版本，官方已在 2.0.3 版本修复该路径遍历漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可通过以下方式缓解：1) 在 php.ini 中开启 magic_quotes_gpc = On（PHP 5.4+ 已废弃）；2) 在 Web 服务器层面限制对 /manager/controllers/default/resource/tvs.php 的访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 访问后台管理目录；3) 部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 路径遍历载荷的 class_key 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://modxcms.com/forums/index.php/topic%2C55104.0.html","http://modxcms.com/forums/index.php/topic%2C55105.msg317273.html","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1009-exploits/modx202pl-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/41638","http://www.johnleitch.net/Vulnerabilities/MODx.Revolution.2.0.2-pl.Local.File.Inclusion/49","http://www.osvdb.org/68265","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/43577","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/62073","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34788","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5278.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-5278.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5278.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-5278.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-5278-2028.yaml","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2010-5278-2030.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5278.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Apr/16/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2010/CVE-2010-5278.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2010-5278_2.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-5278.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0114","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-5028","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9103,\"outputTokens\":25,\"totalTokens\":10856}}","description":"Joomla! JExtensions JE Job (com_jejob) 组件 1.0 版本的 index.php 文件中 item 操作的 catid 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 catid 参数传递特制的 SQL 语句，执行任意 SQL 命令，导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至服务器完全沦陷。该漏洞影响使用该组件的所有 Joomla! 站点，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，属高危漏洞。攻击者可构造恶意 catid 参数值（如 ' UNION SELECT ...）注入 SQL 语句，获取数据库敏感信息或写入 Webshell 进一步控制服务器。厂商已停止维护该组件，建议立即卸载或升级至安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-5028"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-11-02T21:55:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:00Z","remediation":"立即升级或卸载存在漏洞的 Harmistechnology JE Job (com_jejob) 1.0 组件，替换为官方已修复版本或停用该组件。临时缓解措施：在 Joomla 后台禁用 com_jejob 组件，并通过 Web 应用防火墙对 index.php 的 catid 参数做 SQL 注入过滤与输入校验，限制远程匿名访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/39837","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12782","http://www.osvdb.org/64708","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/40193","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/1269","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/58599","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/12601","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5028.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-5028.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5028.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-5028.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-5028-2021.yaml","https://github.com/masahiro331/nvd-list/blob/4937ab886b2d99e2047bc7eafc242f2653ee7558/cves/2010/CVE-2010-5028.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-5028_24.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-5028.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2010/README.md","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2010-5028-2023.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/19/Reports/lfiReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0113","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4977","title":"Miniwork Com Canteen 1.0 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Canteen（com_canteen）组件 1.0 版本在 menu.php 中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该组件在处理用户请求时未对传入 index.php 的 mealid 参数进行严格的输入校验与转义，导致攻击者可通过构造恶意的 SQL 语句拼接至数据库查询中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用该参数执行任意 SQL 命令，进而读取、篡改或删除数据库中的敏感数据，甚至在特定配置下进一步获取系统权限。该漏洞影响所有安装了 Canteen 1.0 组件的 Joomla! 站点，攻击条件仅需目标站点对外开放 Web 服务且存在该缺陷组件，利用方式简单，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4977"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-11-01T22:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:54Z","remediation":"由于 Joomla! Canteen (com_canteen) 组件 1.0 存在 SQL 注入漏洞且厂商已停止维护，建议立即从 Joomla! 后台卸载并彻底删除该扩展。若业务必须使用，应在代码中对 index.php 传入的 mealid 参数强制类型转换为整型（intval）并使用参数化查询/预处理语句，同时部署 WAF 拦截含 SQL 关键字的恶意请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/66031","http://packetstormsecurity.org/1007-exploits/joomlacanteen-lfisql.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/40503","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8495","http://www.salvatorefresta.net/files/adv/Canteen%20Joomla%20Component%201.0%20Multiple%20Remote%20Vulnerabilities-04072010.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/512170/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/41358","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/60103","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/34250","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4977.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4977.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4977.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2010-4977.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-4977-2019.yaml","https://github.com/w4n95/vuls-data-raw-exploit-inthewild/blob/2c8c2568a21a9cc77244882f65c37bca47d71613/2010/CVE-2010-4977.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2010-4977_40.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-4977-2018.yaml","https://github.com/chessredoffsec/nuclei-templates/blob/bf798045b1c57839b4998bf6e08c74fbfd076879/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4977.yaml","https://github.com/wpsec/ARL-Source-Install/blob/aecf83f1f55a6f1a1a67dbe25e22ea0eb5a44bf2/tools/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4977.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0112","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4769","title":"Janguo Jimtawl 组件 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Jimtawl（com_jimtawl）组件 1.0.2 存在目录遍历（路径遍历）漏洞，根源在于其对用户传入的 `task` 参数未做充分的路径安全校验，未过滤 `../`（点点）序列。远程攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下，可向 `index.php` 的 `task` 参数注入包含 `../` 的恶意路径，从而跨越 Web 根目录读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息），并可能借此造成其他未明确说明的安全影响。该漏洞影响运行 Joomla! 并安装了 Jimtawl 1.0.2 组件的网站，攻击条件仅为目标站点存在该脆弱组件且可直接访问前端入口，利用方式简单，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4769"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-03-23T22:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:30Z","remediation":"立即升级或卸载存在漏洞的 Janguo Jimtawl (com_jimtawl) 1.0.2 组件，改用官方已修复的版本；若暂无法升级，请登录 Joomla! 后台在「扩展管理」中禁用或移除该组件，并在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中拒绝 index.php 中 task 参数包含 `../` 序列的请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/42324","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15585","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44992","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15585","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4769.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-4769.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2010/CVE-2010-4769.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fcc97d3f09074a6534df65087e2097c6145b988b/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4769.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2010-4769-2013.yaml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-4769.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2010-4769_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2010-4769-2013.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2010-4769-2012.yaml","https://github.com/patrickmpalmer/exploit-prediction-calculator/blob/a048424e68e6b5ea7f4d32bf29dddd4eda342b01/data_gathering/data/exploited_cves.csv","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2010-4769-2014.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0111","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4719","title":"Fxwebdesign Com Jradio 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 平台的 Fxwebdesign JRadio（com_jradio）组件在 1.5.1 之前版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。该组件在处理 index.php 的 controller 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤与校验，导致远程攻击者可在 controller 参数中插入\"../\"等目录遍历序列，从而突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、敏感源码等）。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，影响所有运行受影响版本 JRadio 组件的 Joomla! 站点，可能导致敏感信息泄露，进而为进一步的入侵提供条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4719"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-02-01T23:00:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:24Z","remediation":"建议将 Joomla! 的 JRadio (com_jradio) 组件升级至 1.5.1 或更高版本，可从官方扩展目录重新下载安装以覆盖存在漏洞的旧版。若无法立即升级，可在 Joomla! 后台禁用或卸载 com_jradio 组件，并通过 Web 服务器规则（如 Apache 的 .htaccess）拒绝对外界暴露 index.php 中 controller 参数的非预期目录遍历字符（../ 等），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/view/96751/joomlajradio-lfi.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/42600","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15749","http://www.fxwebdesign.nl/index.php?optio