 TGA 文件嵌入 ODF 或 Microsoft Office 文档中，诱使用户在受影响版本（OpenOffice.org 2.x 及 3.3 之前版本）中打开，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致应用程序崩溃或远程代码执行。CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4643"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-28T22:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:25:13Z","remediation":"升级 OpenOffice.org 至 3.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 TGA 文件解析中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，避免打开来源不明的 ODF 或 Office 文档，并在邮件网关层面拦截可疑的 TGA 附件。Linux 发行版用户可通过包管理器（如 apt upgrade openoffice.org 或 yum update openoffice.org）安装安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/70718","http://secunia.com/advisories/40775","http://secunia.com/advisories/42999","http://secunia.com/advisories/43065","http://secunia.com/advisories/43105","http://secunia.com/advisories/43118","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://ubuntu.com/usn/usn-1056-1","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2151","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:027","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2010-4643.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2011-301950.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0181.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0182.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46031","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025002","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0230","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0232","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0279","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=667588","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65441","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-4643.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4643.json","https://github.com/apache/openoffice-org/blob/8229366d1e4d6b49b6b7814c530e13f2c4dcb931/content/security/cves/CVE-2010-4643.html","